# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each page, knob, help card, button and
# chord change is said once, in the screen's own text (the words file says it in full)
# the title (ZENITH-1, by Polystellarflow) first: a button during it only skips it
wait 4000
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Garden page: Tempo 66, Evolve 35, Motion 55, Drift 45 seconds. World Warm Space, D Lydian, growing
# (the garden follows, queued: the chord, how far to the next, the scale from the root up)
listen
where
said Scale D, E, F#, Ab and A, B, C#
# a page settles before it is said
tap ENV
wait 300
said Pad page: Level 64, Sound Warm, Swell 70, Bright 45
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Root D, Tune 0, MIDI out On, Lights On
# a knob: its name and value, once it settles
spin K2 3
wait 300
said Tune +3
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Lights Keys
spin K4 -1
wait 300
# SELECT turns the pages
turn SELECT -4
wait 300
said Space page: Echo 40, Echo time 1 bar, Reverb 70, Size 88
spin K2 -1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/2.
tap HOME
wait 300
said Garden page
spin K4 20
wait 300
said Drift 1 minute 17 seconds
# HOME + SELECT: the tempo (the Garden's first knob says it)
press HOME
turn SELECT 2 200
release HOME
wait 300
said Tempo 68
# the keys: a note out of the scale and back in; the root stays
tapkey w1
said ADDED G
tapkey w1
said REMOVED G
tapkey b3
said REMOVED C#
tapkey b3
said ADDED C#
tapkey w5
said THE ROOT STAYS (SETUP)
# the encoders: the mode, the piece (with its key and tempo)
turn ALGO 1
said MODE Mixolyd
turn ALGO -1
said MODE Lydian
turn PRESET 1
said WORLD Cinematic, C Aeolian, tempo 58
wait 300
unsaid Level
turn PRESET -1
said WORLD Warm Space, D Lydian, tempo 68
wait 300
# the buttons' messages, said once
tap REC
said FREEZE ON
tap REC
said FREEZE OFF
tap PLAY
said RESTING
wait 300
unsaid GROWING
tap PLAY
said GROWING
wait 300
unsaid RESTING
tap OCT+
said BELL OCTAVE +1
tap OCT-
said BELL OCTAVE 0
tap EDIT
said HOLD EDIT FOR RANDOM
tap SAVE
said SAVED
wait 100
# the chord moving by itself: queued (said after what is being said). Drift its shortest (on the Garden page)
spin K4 -80
wait 26000
said Chord
# a MIDI clock arriving, and start / stop from it
midi FA 00 00
midi F8 00 00
wait 20
said Tempo EXT
midi FC 00 00
wait 300
said RESTING
wait 1000
said Tempo 68
# WHERE: everything again
where
said Garden page: Tempo 68, Evolve 35, Motion 55, Drift 20 seconds. World Warm Space, D Lydian, resting
